## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a compliant, auditable streaming pipeline focusing on PII redaction, idempotent writes, and backfill—a common real-world requirement for beginner to mid-level roles.

## Key Concepts
- PII redaction in streaming data
- Deduplication with DynamoDB keyed by deviceId+ts
- Backfill strategy using Glue or similar
- Parquet partitioning by region/date
- Observability with CloudWatch and simple SLIs

## Code Example
```javascript
function redact(record){
  const r = JSON.parse(record);
  if (r.userEmail) r.userEmail="REDACTED";
  if (r.phone) r.phone="REDACTED";
  if (r.token) r.token="REDACTED";
  return JSON.stringify(r);
}
```

